  "interpretation": {
    "performance": "MXFP4-PV is consistently faster in forward. The whole-step MX/FP8 difference is unresolved because the approximately 0.70 ms forward saving is small relative to a roughly 253 ms step and independent-process backward/optimizer noise. Both routes still use the same timed projection-publication allocation fallback, which is fair but dilutes the attention-only percentage gain and remains an optimization target.",
